8 Header Line
*************

The enhanced header line displays:

   • *Mark indicator* -- A ‘*’ if the current image is marked
   • *Marked count* -- Number of marked images, shown at the start when
     one or more are marked (e.g., ‘[3 marked]’)
   • *Filename* -- Relative to source directory when subdirectories are
     inserted
   • *Directory* -- Location of the current image, abbreviated (e.g.,
     ‘~/Photos/’); falls back to the source directory
   • *Image count* -- Current position / number of displayed images
     (e.g., ‘23/156’); with a filter on, the filtered set (e.g., ‘3/12’)
   • *Dimensions* -- Width x Height in pixels (e.g., ‘1920x1080’)
   • *File size* -- Human-readable size (e.g., ‘2.4M’)
   • *Sort indicator* -- Current sort field and direction (e.g., ‘[name
     <]’)
   • *Active filters* -- Description of any active filters


