13 Transient Menu Support
*************************

If ‘transient’ is available, ‘dired-image-thumbnail’ provides
interactive menus for sorting and filtering.  These can be accessed
with:

   • ‘s’ / ‘S’ -- Sort (completing-read: dired/name/date/size/reverse)
   • ‘/’ -- Filter (completing-read: name/size/clear)

   To disable transient menus even when transient is installed, don't
load ‘dired-image-thumbnail-transient.el’.


